{"id":"u-f0a3644c-577b-4cc7-aab0-2edc995057e8","src":"community","title":"4/4 by Alk.mex","author":"Αλεξανδρος Σ.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/cnzf1t-build-the-basics","desc":"This 4-week program is designed for strength development using a structured periodization approach. It consists of two phases:\n\t1.\tAccumulation Phase (Weeks 1-2):\n\t•\tFocuses on building work capacity and volume.\n\t•\tUses moderate intensity (70-85% of 1RM) with higher volume (4-10 sets).\n\t•\tAims to develop muscular endurance and technical proficiency in key lifts (Squat, Bench Press, Deadlift, Overhead Press).\n\t2.\tIntensification Phase (Weeks 3-4;):\n\t•\tGradually increases intensity (85-95% of 1RM) while reducing volume.\n\t•\tIncludes heavy triples, doubles, and singles to build maximal strength.\n\t•\tPrepares the lifter for peak performance or a potential max test.\nEat and sleep well !!!\n*(you can repeat week 3)\n*one day off between programs","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Olympic Weightlifting"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":20,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T16:44:48.288Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":5}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":8,"x":5}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":7,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"rpe":8,"x":7}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"rpe":8,"x":7}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"rpe":7.5,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"x":5}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"rpe":8.5,"x":10}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"rpe":8.5,"x":10}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"rpe":8,"x":5}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"rpe":8,"x":6}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"